  <name>MintCam</name>
  <summary>Webcam app for Linux Mint</summary>
  <description>
    <p>MintCam is a lightweight desktop webcam application for Linux Mint.</p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Live webcam preview with real-time FPS counter</li>
      <li>Live RTMP streaming to custom server URLs</li>
      <li>Audio recording via ALSA using ffmpeg</li>
      <li>Background blur (Bokeh) effect using skin color segmentation</li>
      <li>Motion detection auto-recording</li>
      <li>Photo capture with burst mode</li>
      <li>Video recording with codec auto-detection</li>
      <li>QR code scanner</li>
      <li>Focus assist (Laplacian variance scoring)</li>
      <li>Face auto-framing</li>
      <li>Time-lapse recording</li>
      <li>Social sharing integration (Telegram, Discord, GitHub, Google Drive)</li>
      <li>Basic filters and adjustments</li>
      <li>Dark theme UI</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <categories>
    <category>AudioVideo</category>
    <category>Video</category>
